<title>SPAIN: Caja San Fernando, Caja Granada buy Uniasa stakes.</title>
<headline>Caja San Fernando, Caja Granada buy Uniasa stakes.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caja San Fernando bought five percent and Caja General de Granada bought 5.5 percent of the capital of Puleva Uniasa from Santander Investment, Javier Tallada, the president of Puleva told Reuters.</p>
</text>
